  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place chicken broth, soy sauce, hoisin, water, cornstarch, 2 tablespoons plus 1 teaspoon brown sugar, olive oil, rice vinegar, sesame oil, ginger paste, garlic, white pepper, five-spice powder, and Sriracha into a small mixing bowl. Using a whisk, mix ingredients until they are fully incorporated.",
